  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;"&gt;1) Targa Badlands LLC filed its initial FERC Form No. 6 for the year ended December 31, 2025. This FERC Form No. 6&amp;#8209;Q for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 represents the Targa Badlands LLC&amp;#8217;s second quarterly filing with the Commission. Accordingly, comparative period amounts for the prior year quarter and prior year&amp;#8209;to&amp;#8209;date periods are presented as zero, as no FERC Form No. 6&amp;#8209;Q filings were required or filed for such periods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock id="HH11476EB422E065C84DE3B12A8533C405" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;2) During the first quarter of 2026, an overstatement of the asset retirement obligation asset and liability as of December 31, 2025 was identified. Correction of the overstatement resulted in an increase of approximately $11.0 million to retained earnings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: #7030a0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock>
